message: "If you use GPEC, please cite it as below. If you use the 3D vacuum calculation, please also cite BIEST and the papers listed under references."
type: software
title: "GPEC: Generalized Perturbed Equilibrium Code"
abstract: "A Julia implementation of the GPEC suite for magnetohydrodynamic (MHD) analysis of fusion plasmas: equilibrium reconstruction, ideal MHD stability, and the perturbed-equilibrium response to external magnetic perturbations."
